Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `load` uses the effect `FS.Read`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effects/effects_propagate_transitively.jet:4:26
    |
  4 | load: fn(path: String) -[Net]> String { return helper(path) }
    |                          ^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[Net]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the effect list, or stop using it in `load`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: load
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
